- AI Hub: [AI Hub](/ai-hub), Calendar: [Calendar](/calendar), Approvals: [Approvals](/approvals)

When a user asks about navigation, always provide the direct link. When describing items, include links to relevant pages.
Use markdown formatting: **bold** for emphasis, bullet lists for multiple items, and [text](/path) for all links.`;
      if (input.context) {
